<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch PTT sets 1.00 guilder interim div.</title>
<headline>Dutch PTT sets 1.00 guilder interim div.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch post and telecoms group PTT Nederland NV said it would pay a 1996 interim dividend of 1.00 guilders per share.  </p>
<p>The company paid a 1995 interim dividend of 0.90 guilders per share.</p>
<p>Shareholders can opt for payment of the 1996 interim dividend in cash or alternatively can receive one new share for every 62 shares already held.</p>
<p>The 1996 interim dividend will be payable from September 30 and Dutch PTT shares will trade ex the interim dividend from September 18.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
